# ── Build context for docker/Dockerfile.api and docker/Dockerfile.web ──
# Keep the context small & reproducible: the image must never depend on
# local node_modules, .env secrets or previous builds.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-server
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
logs
data

# ── secrets: never enter an image layer ────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt

# ── not needed to build the app ────────────────────────────────────────
docs
README.md
README.DOCKER.md
LICENSE.md
Makefile
docker-compose*.yml
compose*.yml
scripts/docker-build.sh
scripts/smoke-test.sh
.vscode
.idea
sed*
